{"id": "FM-0866349abb048f1b", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "例1　(多选)已知函数f(x)=x^(2)+(m-3)x+m的两个零点分别为x_(1)，x_(2)，且x_(1)<x_(2)，则下列结论正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，由题意得{x_(1)+x_(2)=3−m>0,; x_(1)x_(2)=m>0,; Δ=(m−3)^(2)−4m>0,}解得0<m<1，A正确；\n对于B，f(1)=2m-2<0，解得m<1，B正确；\n对于C，{f(−2)=10−m>0,; f(0)=m<0,; f(4)=5m+4>0,}解得-(4)/(5)<m<0，C错误；\n对于D，{f(2)=3m−2<0,; f(4)=5m+4<0,}解得m<-(4)/(5)，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K014", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用", "source_question_number": "例1", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 5–14", "source_sha256": "7b1851320c542276a55bb3d4b6ab48c9f5e4effdf12980cb5cb95b9ae125d796", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "当x_(1)>0且x_(2)>0时，0<m<1", "B": "当x_(1)<1且x_(2)>1时，m<1", "C": "当-2<x_(1)<0且0<x_(2)<4时，m<-(4)/(5)", "D": "当x_(1)<2且x_(2)>4时，m<-(4)/(5)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "D"], "raw_answer": "ABD", "fingerprint": "fd82784028c44a57e79f9655404bcaa1b5f0e572715a929bbcb955905c98d443", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-ecdf6315770ecd49", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "6.某地下车库在排气扇发生故障的情况下测得空气中一氧化碳含量达到了危险状态，经抢修排气扇恢复正常，排气4分钟后测得车库内的一氧化碳浓度为64 ppm，继续排气4分钟后又测得浓度为32 ppm.由检验知该地下车库一氧化碳浓度y(单位：ppm)与排气时间t(单位：分钟)之间满足函数关系y=ae^(Rt)(a，R为常数，e是自然对数的底数).若空气中一氧化碳浓度不高于0.5 ppm，人就可以安全进入车库了，则下列说法正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "设f(t)=ae^(Rt)，由题意得{ae^(4R)=64,; ae^(8R)=32,}\n解得{a=128,; R=−(1)/(4)ln2,}A正确，B错误；\n此时f(t)=128(e^(R))^(t)=2^(7)·(2^(−(1)/(4)))^(t)=2^(7−(t)/(4))，\n所以f(12)=2^(4)=16(ppm)，C正确；\n当f(t)≤0.5时，2^(7−(t)/(4))≤0.5=2^(-1)，得7-(t)/(4)≤-1，所以t≥32，所以排气32分钟后，人可以安全进入车库，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K010", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.12　函数模型的应用.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.12　函数模型的应用", "source_question_number": "6.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 281–291", "source_sha256": "c0572c0a6b8e21e851bf0fa393f9e3792e048cf9774176514d12df2c03d555d7", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "a=128", "B": "R=(1)/(4)ln 2", "C": "排气12分钟后浓度为16 ppm", "D": "排气32分钟后，人可以安全进入车库"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "C", "D"], "raw_answer": "ACD", "fingerprint": "5a6b2b0a025ccbf3cc4d8606c67c1d73e908e9cf98494846265e95ff081edd17", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-6130d52ac390ffaa", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "例1　(1)(多选)下列选项中正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，由题意知{4−x>0,; x−2≠0,}解得x<4且x≠2，A正确；\n对于B，由函数的定义知，函数图象与y轴至多有一个交点，B正确；\n对于C，函数y=(x^(2)−1)/(x+1)的定义域为(-∞，-1)∪(-1，+∞)，函数y=x-1的定义域为R，两函数定义域不同，故这两个函数不是同一个函数，C错误；\n对于D，函数中一个x值只能对应一个y值，如果y的值不同，则x的值一定不同，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K002", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示", "source_question_number": "例1　(1)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 50–59", "source_sha256": "bfae8dfc6e13ba99cb9fbdb0e2a12574832dae6410fe637d5e24353e2a7730a1", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "函数y=(lg(4−x))/(x−2)的定义域为(-∞，2)∪(2，4)", "B": "函数图象与y轴至多有一个交点", "C": "函数y=(x^(2)−1)/(x+1)与函数y=x-1表示同一个函数", "D": "对于任何一个函数，如果因变量y的值不同，则自变量x的值一定不同"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "D"], "raw_answer": "ABD", "fingerprint": "0a38b1cab1e18ed67f079459b598243f549808390e11009fb33edc3cc646b281", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-20b0a6e0d0a89662", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "8.(2026·昆明模拟)已知函数f(x)对于一切实数x，y都有f(x+y)=f(x)f(y)，当x>0时，0<f(x)<1，f(1)=(1)/(5)，则下列结论正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，令x=1，y=0，\n则f(1)=f(1)f(0)，\n∵f(1)=(1)/(5)，∴f(0)=1，故A正确；\n对于B，f(2)=f(1)f(1)=(1)/(25)，故B错误；\n对于C，令y=-x，则f(x)f(-x)=f(x-x)=f(0)=1，\n当x<0时，-x>0，∴0<f(-x)<1，∴f(x)=(1)/(f(−x))>0，\n∴f(x)>0恒成立，故C正确；\n对于D，设x_(2)>x_(1)，\n则f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))=f[(x_(2)-x_(1))+x_(1)]-f(x_(1))=f(x_(2)-x_(1))f(x_(1))-f(x_(1))=f(x_(1))[f(x_(2)-x_(1))-1]，\n∵x_(2)-x_(1)>0，∴0<f(x_(2)-x_(1))<1，即f(x_(2)-x_(1))-1<0，\n又f(x_(1))>0，∴f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))<0，f(x)是减函数，故D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "8.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 279–295", "source_sha256": "4a4da4a043a4a5f8afa3779129d634179d1dad121b475e710a0733c1cb0f34fb", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(0)=1", "B": "若f(m)=25，则m=2", "C": "f(x)>0恒成立", "D": "f(x)是减函数"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "C", "D"], "raw_answer": "ACD", "fingerprint": "ade70c08eab83424341001656818ee5c470229de46027021ec043267b148771b", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-3f8e1111acf1ea43", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "3.(多选)若函数f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，则下列结论正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "因为f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，所以f(x)+f(-x)=0，且f(0)=0，A，B正确；\n因为f(-x)=-f(x)，所以f(x)·f(-x)=-[f(x)]^(2)≤0，当x=0时，等号成立，C正确；\n当x=0时，f(-x)=0，此时(f(x))/(f(−x))无意义，D错误.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "3.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 29–37", "source_sha256": "2b98749942d46405dc0feb9ed1acfc75b54a012461b9fd5891e462e26657f25e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(x)+f(-x)=0", "B": "f(0)=0", "C": "f(x)·f(-x)≤0", "D": "(f(x))/(f(−x))=-1"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "C"], "raw_answer": "ABC", "fingerprint": "6783076ec903e85384e1ce36d913ac6cd0cf1a4c48c8d3f3d3ec9833e35ea40b", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-2d58335465d5487c", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "11.(多选)(2025·漳州模拟)已知定义在R上的函数f(x)不恒等于0，f(π)=0，且对任意的x，y∈R，都有f(2x)+f(2y)=2f(x+y)f(x-y)，则(　　)", "explanation": "根据题意，f(2x)+f(2y)=2f(x+y)f(x-y)，\n对于A，令y=x，可得f(2x)+f(2x)=2f(2x)f(0)，解得f(0)=1，即A正确；\n对于B，令y=-x可得f(2x)+f(-2x)=2f(0)f(2x)=2f(2x)，所以f(2x)=f(-2x)，\n即可得对任意的x∈R满足f(x)=f(-x)，即f(x)是偶函数，所以B正确；\n对于C，令x=π-y，可得f(2π-2y)+f(2y)=2f(π)f(π-2y)=0，\n即f(x)满足f(2π-x)+f(x)=0，因此可得f(x)的图象关于点(π，0)中心对称，即C正确；\n对于D，假设2π是f(x)的一个周期，则f(2π)=f(0)=1，又f(2π-x)+f(x)=0，令x=0，得f(2π)+f(0)=0，即f(2π)=-f(0)=-1≠f(0)，故2π不是f(x)的一个周期，即D错误.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K006", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K005"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K005"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性", "source_question_number": "11.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 296–308", "source_sha256": "25d7a7bc92d4bc1b26b7b8da5051d6538bd27288a37b004ba4235b042f40b32f", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(0)=1", "B": "f(x)是偶函数", "C": "f(x)的图象关于点(π，0)中心对称", "D": "2π是f(x)的一个周期"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "C"], "raw_answer": "ABC", "fingerprint": "165d01b63e0937e9964b6750e3c9f7a6f9716896467ab82cf2d914d7cef30fdb", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-203124b073f820fa", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "例1　(1)(多选)下列命题中正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "A选项，幂函数的图象一定经过点(1，1)，若幂函数在x=0处有定义，则其图象过点(0，0)，若幂函数在x=0处没有定义，则其图象一定不过点(0，0)，A错误；\nB选项，幂函数f(x)=x^(α)，当x>0时，f(x)=x^(α)>0，所以幂函数的图象一定经过第一象限，一定不经过第四象限，B正确；\nC选项，由题意可得m^(2)-m-1=1且-m+1<0，解得m=2，C正确；\nD选项，若α为奇数，则幂函数f(x)=x^(α)为奇函数，若幂函数f(x)=x^(α)为奇函数，α并不一定为奇数，例如f(x)=x^((1)/(3))=root(3,x)，故“α为奇数”是“幂函数f(x)=x^(α)为奇函数”的充分不必要条件，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K008", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 1, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation", "concept_understanding"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数", "source_question_number": "例1　(1)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 78–87", "source_sha256": "f3e07be2e9eb04b2560d04dfa55eae9b881bcf6b1a2087c16269f81e846ee462", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "幂函数的图象都经过点(0，0)，(1，1)", "B": "幂函数的图象一定经过第一象限，一定不经过第四象限", "C": "若幂函数y=(m^(2)-m-1)x^(-m+1)在(0，+∞)上单调递减，则实数m的值为2", "D": "“α为奇数”是“幂函数f(x)=x^(α)为奇函数”的充分不必要条件"}, "correct_answers": ["B", "C", "D"], "raw_answer": "BCD", "fingerprint": "5f620fe70c9ba0cb4ad988c43ef778de1b2a14f715e61a138e68ef458e7a428c", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-0c83b8f5a4b3f4cc", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "7.下列各式正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，因为2^(a)=(2)/(3)，所以8^(a)=2^(3a)=(2^(a))^(3)=(8)/(27)，A正确；\n对于B，a^((2m+3n)/(2))=a^(m)·a^((3n)/(2))=3·(a^(n))^((3)/(2))=3×4^((3)/(2))=3×(2^(2))^((3)/(2))=3×2^(3)=3×8=24，B正确；\n对于C，root(4,aroot(3,a))=root(4,a·a^((1)/(3)))=(a^((4)/(3)))^((1)/(4))=a^((1)/(3))，C错误；\n对于D，4a^((2)/(3))b^(−(1)/(3))÷(−(2)/(3)a^(−(1)/(3))b^((2)/(3)))=4×(−(3)/(2))×a^((2)/(3)−(−(1)/(3)))b^(−(1)/(3)−(2)/(3))=-6ab^(-1)，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K009", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 1, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation", "concept_understanding"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 293–302", "source_sha256": "ec6f7661553cca7157518fc1cf4a9380542f8134559850d06c43bcbe2eb65b0e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "若2^(a)=(2)/(3)，则8^(a)=(8)/(27)", "B": "若a^(m)=3，a^(n)=4，则a^((2m+3n)/(2))=24", "C": "若a>0，则root(4,aroot(3,a))=a^((7)/(12))", "D": "若a>0，b>0，则4a^((2)/(3))b^(−(1)/(3))÷(−(2)/(3)a^(−(1)/(3))b^((2)/(3)))=-6ab^(-1)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "D"], "raw_answer": "ABD", "fingerprint": "c2177ced9ca0f4095ac5778c18fbd29cdb6145632dc400522002cfd8c7901c4b", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-00e0f8049c41c3db", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "8.(2026·烟台模拟)已知函数f(x)=lg(x^(2)+ax-a)，下列说法中正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "选项A，x^(2)+ax-a>0对任意x∈R恒成立，即Δ=a^(2)+4a<0，解得-4<a<0，A正确；\n选项B，x^(2)+ax-a≤0有解，因此Δ=a^(2)+4a≥0，解得a≤-4或a≥0，B正确；\n选项C，当a=2时，f(x)=lg(x^(2)+2x-2)，由x^(2)+2x-2=(x+1)^(2)-3>0得x<-1-sqrt(3)或x>-1+sqrt(3)，根据复合函数的单调性得其单调递减区间是(-∞，-1-sqrt(3))，C错误；\n选项D，f(x)在(-2，-1)上单调递减，\n则{−(a)/(2)≥−1,; 1−a−a≥0,}解得a≤(1)/(2)，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K001", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 1, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "concept_understanding"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数", "source_question_number": "8.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 252–262", "source_sha256": "4e670ab7e922a6620ab14b5ad2aeb1b90cfc2e4a96ce6e02f27dd7d3508f9568", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "若f(x)的定义域为R，则a的取值范围是(-4，0)", "B": "若f(x)的值域为R，则a的取值范围是(-∞，-4]∪[0，+∞)", "C": "若a=2，则f(x)的单调递减区间为(-∞，-1)", "D": "若f(x)在(-2，-1)上单调递减，则a的取值范围是(−∞，(1)/(2)]"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "D"], "raw_answer": "ABD", "fingerprint": "64b07d8b1ebf9836e456e2c82a7697d24f2a7e47b20af54f5c76e86b2c336383", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-ec9e1aa9aa002944", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "7.(2025·保定模拟)下列不等式成立的有(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，log_(0.3)0.2>log_(0.3)0.3=1，log_(0.2)0.3<log_(0.2)0.2=1，故log_(0.3)0.2>log_(0.2)0.3，A正确；\n对于B，0.3^(0.2)>0.3^( ^(0.3))>0.2^(0.3)，故0.3^(0.2)>0.2^(0.3)，B正确；\n对于C，由于log_(3)0.2<0，log_(2)0.2<0，故(log_(2)0.2)/(log_(3)0.2)=((1)/(log_(0.2)2))/((1)/(log_(0.2)3))=(log_(0.2)3)/(log_(0.2)2)=log_(2)3>1，故log_(3)0.2>log_(2)0.2，C错误；\n对于D，因为(3^(0.2))^(10)=3^(2)=9，(2^(0.3))^(10)=2^(3)=8，所以(3^(0.2))^(10)>(2^(0.3))^(10)，故3^(0.2)>2^(0.3)，D错误.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K011", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.8　指、对、幂的大小比较.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.8　指、对、幂的大小比较", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 163–170", "source_sha256": "ea22337bf55865e6c0c65c7f8fad4c96ccc2d3c0bd685c92184706145255a550", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "log_(0.3)0.2>log_(0.2)0.3", "B": "0.3^(0.2)>0.2^(0.3)", "C": "log_(3)0.2<log_(2)0.2", "D": "3^(0.2)<2^(0.3)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B"], "raw_answer": "AB", "fingerprint": "d47ef76e2ccf0992b667a296847f95a0b2c83158f0586028b5f34976ecbbcb5c", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-61d3c361acf6b6e5", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "7.(2025·邵阳模拟)下列函数对于任意x_(1)，x_(2)∈(0，+∞)，都有f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))≥(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)成立的是(　　)", "explanation": "因为对任意x_(1)，x_(2)∈(0，+∞)，都有f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))≥(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)，则函数在(0，+∞)上为上凸函数，\n对于A，f(x)=ln x在(0，+∞)上的图象是上凸的，符合题意；\n对于B，f(x)=x^(2)+1在(0，+∞)上的图象是下凸的，不符合题意；\n对于C，f(x)=x^((2)/(3))在(0，+∞)上的图象是上凸的，符合题意；\n对于D，f(x)=2^(x)在(0，+∞)上的图象是下凸的，不符合题意.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K001", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 1, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "concept_understanding"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.9　函数的图象.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.9　函数的图象", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 224–232", "source_sha256": "6dcbe9321d132aa6947b40f4f1faf8fa5ae8555fb0608b50324cf7e0799557aa", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(x)=ln x", "B": "f(x)=x^(2)+1", "C": "f(x)=x^((2)/(3))", "D": "f(x)=2^(x)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "C"], "raw_answer": "AC", "fingerprint": "3d8d4d1ae3f7f894b7af8bc558bc1f4564a51a5028047a80705cec9edfb3d4b0", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-db0dfd2058c8dd15", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "11.已知函数f(x)的定义域为R，其图象关于点(2，1)中心对称，若f(x)-f(2-x)=4-4x，则下列结论正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，函数f(x)的定义域为R，其图象关于点(2，1)中心对称，\n则f(4-x)+f(x)=2，A正确；\n对于B，f(2)=1，又f(x)-f(2-x)=4-4x，取x=0，则f(0)-f(2)=4，解得f(0)=5，B错误；\n对于C，在f(4-x)+f(x)=2中，取x=1，得f(1)+f(3)=2，因此f(0)+f(1)+f(2)+f(3)=8，C正确；\n对于D，由f(x)-f(2-x)=4-4x，\n得f(-x)-f(2+x)=4+4x，\n两式相加得f(x)+f(-x)-[f(2-x)+f(2+x)]=8，而f(2-x)+f(2+x)=2，\n则f(-x)+f(x)=10，即f(-2-x)+f(2+x)=10，因此f(2-x)-f(-2-x)=-8，\n即f(x+4)-f(x)=-8，而2 026=4×506+2，所以f(2 026)=f(2)+506×(-8)=-4 047，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K006", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题2　函数的概念与性质.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题2　函数的概念与性质", "source_question_number": "11.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 119–133", "source_sha256": "8a3090a0ac7a0b0ea1eb450da245b9f84fa595720e72110c6519840779682806", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(4-x)+f(x)=2", "B": "f(0)=4", "C": "f(0)+f(1)+f(2)+f(3)=8", "D": "f(2 026)=-4 047"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "C", "D"], "raw_answer": "ACD", "fingerprint": "f7a5342e5bbd3517cce6a1b49e93418a376a0bcf22576b525d70f9ea6543f8e2", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-1f348fcf8f2d59cd", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "10.(2026·邢台模拟)已知幂函数f(x)的图象经过点((1)/(4)，(1)/(2))，则下列说法正确的为(　　)", "explanation": "设幂函数f(x)=x^(a)，由于图象经过点((1)/(4)，(1)/(2))，\n所以((1)/(4))^(a)=(1)/(2)，即a=(1)/(2)，\n所以f(x)=x^((1)/(2))，\n故f(x)在定义域[0，+∞)上单调递增，A正确；\n显然f(x)为非奇非偶函数，B错误；\n由f(x)=sqrt(x)≤2，解得0≤x≤4，C正确；\n当0<x_(1)<x_(2)时，((sqrt(x_(1))+sqrt(x_(2)))/(2))^(2)-(sqrt((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2)))^(2)\n=(x_(1)+x_(2)+2sqrt(x_(1)x_(2)))/(4)-(x_(1)+x_(2))/(2)\n=(−(x_(1)+x_(2))+2sqrt(x_(1)x_(2)))/(4)=(−(sqrt(x_(1))−sqrt(x_(2)))^(2))/(4)<0，\n故(sqrt(x_(1))+sqrt(x_(2)))/(2)<sqrt((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))，\n即(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)<f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))成立，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K008", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题3　基本初等函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题3　基本初等函数", "source_question_number": "10.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 82–98", "source_sha256": "e787e0fd585e547b1af86d7e786b3f1449f337a3875adc1e700bbca67406f78d", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(x)为增函数", "B": "f(x)为偶函数", "C": "若f(x)≤2，则0≤x≤4", "D": "若0<x_(1)<x_(2)，则(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)<f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "C", "D"], "raw_answer": "ACD", "fingerprint": "a9caaa80b643ec78fe3ce08079a1a9218bc6d84a18a86ebf3f1499faa96510f3", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-df8803c651762386", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "5.(2025·贵阳模拟)关于x的方程ax^(2)+2x-1=0至少有一个正实根，则实数a的值可以是(　　)", "explanation": "当a=0时，方程为2x-1=0，解得x=(1)/(2)，方程有一个正实根；\n当a≠0时，方程ax^(2)+2x-1=0的根不为0.\n①当方程ax^(2)+2x-1=0有一个正实根和一个负实根时，{Δ=4+4a>0,; x_(1)x_(2)=−(1)/(a)<0,}解得a>0.\n②当方程ax^(2)+2x-1=0有两个正实根时，{Δ=4+4a≥0,; x_(1)+x_(2)=−(2)/(a)>0,; x_(1)x_(2)=−(1)/(a)>0,}解得-1≤a<0.\n综上，a的取值范围为[-1，+∞)，\n结合选项可知，实数a的值可以是-1，0，1.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K014", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用", "source_question_number": "5.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 140–148", "source_sha256": "7b1851320c542276a55bb3d4b6ab48c9f5e4effdf12980cb5cb95b9ae125d796", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "0", "B": "-1", "C": "1", "D": "-2"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "C"], "raw_answer": "ABC", "fingerprint": "30abba52f36652e49ef1def7c4c426e4c0b4a7ab6714cc390bc24bfe454b8728", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-930e86ac43934e74", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "3.(多选)(2025·三明模拟)下列各组中的f(x)与g(x)不是同一个函数的是(　　)", "explanation": "选项A，函数f(x)=x^(0)的定义域为{x|x≠0}，函数 g(x)=1的定义域为R，二者定义域不同，不是同一个函数；\n选项B，g(x)=sqrt(x^(2))=|x|与f(x)的对应关系不同，不是同一个函数；\n选项C，函数f(x)的定义域为(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)，g(t)的定义域为(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)，\n两函数定义域相同，对应关系相同，是同一个函数；\n选项D，f(x)=sqrt(x^(2)−1)的定义域为(-∞，-1]∪[1，+∞)，g(x)=sqrt(x−1)·sqrt(x+1)的定义域为[1，+∞)，二者定义域不同，不是同一个函数.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K002", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示", "source_question_number": "3.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 28–38", "source_sha256": "bfae8dfc6e13ba99cb9fbdb0e2a12574832dae6410fe637d5e24353e2a7730a1", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(x)=x^(0)与g(x)=1", "B": "f(x)=x与g(x)=sqrt(x^(2))", "C": "f(x)=(x^(2)+2x−3)/(x)和g(t)=(t^(2)+2t−3)/(t)", "D": "f(x)=sqrt(x^(2)−1)与g(x)=sqrt(x−1)·sqrt(x+1)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "D"], "raw_answer": "ABD", "fingerprint": "79b7a079cda0b25ef502f1702ac563d8fb8afc15fd999e59c35035d47ec6f47c", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-2b3c86ee6099332c", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "7.设函数f(x)为增函数，且f(x)≠0，则下列结论错误的是(　　)", "explanation": "若f(x)=x(x≠0)，则y=(1)/(|f(x)|)=(1)/(|x|)(x≠0)，不是减函数，故A错误；\ny=|f(x)|=|x|(x≠0)，不是增函数，故B错误；\ny=-(1)/(f(x))=-(1)/(x)(x≠0)，不是增函数，故C错误；\n对于D，函数f(x)为增函数，则对于定义域内的任意的x_(1)，x_(2)，\n设x_(1)<x_(2)，必有f(x_(1))<f(x_(2))，\n对于y=-f(x)，则有y_(1)-y_(2)=[-f(x_(1))]-[-f(x_(2))]=f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))>0，\n则y=-f(x)为减函数，故D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 266–278", "source_sha256": "4a4da4a043a4a5f8afa3779129d634179d1dad121b475e710a0733c1cb0f34fb", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "y=(1)/(|f(x)|)为减函数", "B": "y=|f(x)|为增函数", "C": "y=-(1)/(f(x))为增函数", "D": "y=-f(x)为减函数"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "C"], "raw_answer": "ABC", "fingerprint": "3f4411e1022f6fe6ee050ce1f8deaada5dfa7dd36a26116be2d7922f1c9328e2", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-08ebe391d2ffbd92", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "7.(2025·毕节模拟)已知f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，g(x)是定义在R上的偶函数，则(　　)", "explanation": "因为f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，所以f(-x)=-f(x)；\ng(x)是定义在R上的偶函数，所以g(-x)=g(x)，\n则f(-x)g(-x)=-f(x)g(x)，所以f(x)g(x)为奇函数，故A正确；\nf(g(-x))=f(g(x))，所以f(g(x))为偶函数，故B错误；\nf(-x)-g(-x)=-f(x)-g(x)，则f(x)-g(x)为非奇非偶函数，故C错误；\ng(f(-x))=g(-f(x))=g(f(x))，故g(f(x))为偶函数，故D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 265–274", "source_sha256": "2b98749942d46405dc0feb9ed1acfc75b54a012461b9fd5891e462e26657f25e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(x)g(x)是奇函数", "B": "f(g(x))是奇函数", "C": "f(x)-g(x)是奇函数", "D": "g(f(x))是偶函数"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "D"], "raw_answer": "AD", "fingerprint": "49a2573277f186613de17515fac455035086cf815cca0abc56d45f1f658437c4", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-5b5f705e1c3ba131", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "跟踪训练1　(多选)定义在R上的奇函数f(x)满足f(x-3)=-f(x)，当x∈[0，3]时，f(x)=x^(2)-3x，则下列结论正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "因为f(x-3)=-f(x)，所以f(x)=-f(x+3)，则f(x-3)=f(x+3)，所以f(x+6)=f(x)，故A正确；\n当x∈[0，3]时，f(x)=x^(2)-3x，则当x∈[-6，-3]时，x+6∈[0，3]，f(x)=f(x+6)=(x+6)^(2)-3(x+6)=x^(2)+9x+18，故B不正确；\n由f(x+6)=f(x)，得函数f(x)的一个周期为6，得f(2 023)=f(1+337×6)=f(1)=-2，f(2 025)=f(3+337×6)=f(3)=0，f(2 024)=f(2+337×6)=f(2)=-2，所以f(2 023)+f(2 025)=f(2 024)，故C正确；\n由A选项知，f(x)=-f(x+3)，又f(x)=-f(-x)，则f(x+3)=f(-x)，所以函数f(x)的图象的一条对称轴为直线x=(3)/(2)，故D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性", "source_question_number": "跟踪训练1", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 81–90", "source_sha256": "25d7a7bc92d4bc1b26b7b8da5051d6538bd27288a37b004ba4235b042f40b32f", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "f(x+6)=f(x)", "B": "当x∈[-6，-3]时，f(x)=x^(2)-3x-6", "C": "f(2 023)+f(2 025)=f(2 024)", "D": "函数f(x)的图象的一条对称轴为直线x=(3)/(2)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "C", "D"], "raw_answer": "ACD", "fingerprint": "6d61cdf4f0b0be91b74039671b18543c4a9901e02c46e2a5cbcca0b1eb1d5c0d", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-341cd4ee9c37dc84", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "8.(2025·金华期末)已知f(x)=x^(α)(α∈R)，则下列说法正确的是(　　)", "explanation": "当α=3时，f(x)=x^(3)在R上单调递增，所以f(π)>f(3)，故A正确；\n若函数f(x)的图象与y轴没有交点，则函数f(x)在x=0处没有定义，故α<0，故B正确；\n当α=(1)/(2)时，f(x)=x^((1)/(2))(x≥0)，则[f(x)]^(2)=x(x≥0)，定义域不关于原点对称，故[f(x)]^(2)为非奇非偶函数，故C错误；\n若α=2，则f(x)=x^(2)，\nf ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))=((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))^(2)=(x_(1)^(2)+2x_(1)x_(2)+x_(2)^(2))/(4)，\n(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)=(x_(1)^(2)+x_(2)^(2))/(2)，\n故f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))-(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)\n=(x_(1)^(2)+2x_(1)x_(2)+x_(2)^(2))/(4)-(x_(1)^(2)+x_(2)^(2))/(2)\n=(−x_(1)^(2)+2x_(1)x_(2)−x_(2)^(2))/(4)\n=(−(x_(1)−x_(2))^(2))/(4)≤0，当且仅当x_(1)=x_(2)时，等号成立，\n故f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))≤(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)，D正确.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K008", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 1, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation", "concept_understanding"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数", "source_question_number": "8.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 276–292", "source_sha256": "f3e07be2e9eb04b2560d04dfa55eae9b881bcf6b1a2087c16269f81e846ee462", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "当α=3时，f(π)>f(3)", "B": "若函数f(x)的图象与y轴没有交点，则α<0", "C": "当α=(1)/(2)时，[f(x)]^(2)是奇函数", "D": "若α=2，则对任意实数x_(1)，x_(2)，有f ((x_(1)+x_(2))/(2))≤(f(x_(1))+f(x_(2)))/(2)"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "D"], "raw_answer": "ABD", "fingerprint": "54328ff5a19847b068d51f3bcf2f9104891b1da566fd218c0d3ca406d69706f4", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FM-465521853817e02b", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "stem": "跟踪训练1　(1)(多选)下列各式正确的是(式中字母均是正数)(　　)", "explanation": "对于A，a^((4)/(6))=a^((2)/(3))=root(3,a^(2))，故A正确；\n对于B，root(4,a^(4))=|a|=a，故B正确；\n对于C，(6^(sqrt(2)))^(sqrt(2))=6^(sqrt(2)×sqrt(2))=6^(2)=36，故C正确；\n对于D，a^(−(2)/(3))=(1)/(a^((2)/(3)))=(1)/(root(3,a^(2)))，故D错误.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K009", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 1, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation", "concept_understanding"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数", "source_question_number": "跟踪训练1　(1)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 81–88", "source_sha256": "ec6f7661553cca7157518fc1cf4a9380542f8134559850d06c43bcbe2eb65b0e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "options": {"A": "a^((4)/(6))=root(3,a^(2))", "B": "root(4,a^(4))=a", "C": "(6^(sqrt(2)))^(sqrt(2))=36", "D": "a^(−(2)/(3))=-root(3,a^(2))"}, "correct_answers": ["A", "B", "C"], "raw_answer": "ABC", "fingerprint": "7598a66fbcf160243d4c60f0be83e911b24b350ab13bc2db419cd51befc9d9e6", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
